      "message": "Instead of adding a new context interface, what about making this a function parameter, like this:\n\ntype AndroidMkExtraEntriesFunc func(Provider func(blueprint.ProviderKey) interface{}, entries *AndroidMkEntries)\n\nIMHO, this is more reader-friendly. I often have to search for the definition of a context interface and then still forget it in 5 mins when reading Soong code because there are multiple \"context\" interface types involved in a logic chain in many cases.\n\nThis way, you won\u0027t probably have to change the function signatures of fillInEntries and fillInData or add fillInEntriesContext.",
